key "Column 3: $\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574707} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c4186a2d-5f92-5f6f-bae2-f7420ca91661" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574451} {:answer/id #uuid "beb34dc9-d246-5a67-aac2-909e4faa5d84" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574452}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c4186a2d-5f92-5f6f-bae2-f7420ca91661" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574451} :answer-field/id #uuid "7a4733a3-524a-5480-b705-7eced9c9ded2" :answer-field/key "Column 4: $\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186574708}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e5c6439d-a09e-5872-bb6c-985034969e09" :question/math-academy-id "q-73609" :question/problem "The row echelon form matrix $M$ is given below. What are the pivot columns of $M?$\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that the pivots of a matrix in row echelon form are the first non-zero entries in each row of the matrix.\n\nWe can see that $M$ has $3$ pivots in the $1$st, $2$nd, and $3$rd columns:\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 7 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342031 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124477 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "488c9762-554b-5ea6-b414-ce6cbde9bbd1" :knowledge-p